o<abort_tool_change> sub
; Clean cancel after program.abort during M600 / toolsetter / job.
; Retract Z, then park at tool-load XY (same as tool_touch_off load position).
; No M73 — Stop now restores G43 in on_abort; M73 would save that and
; restore G43 on endsub, undoing the G49 this routine needs.

M5
M9
M50 P1
G90
G40
; G49 stays here on purpose. Dialog abort is mid-M600: the cutter in the
; collet may not match H anymore. Global Stop does not use this file —
; it keeps G43 via on_abort -> restore_tool_length. Revert of Stop/G43
; policy: docs/DEVIATIONS.md "Keep G43 on Stop".
G49

G53 G0 Z0
G53 G0 X270 Y100
G53 G0 Z0

o<abort_tool_change> endsub
M2
